<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Biopsys cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Biopsys cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber downgraded Biopsys Medical Inc to neutral from attractive.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Biopsys gained 1/32 to 26-29/32.</p>
</text>
